WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:02.262
Unit 1 is where the client runs.

2
00:00:02.262 --> 00:00:07.208
Learn's client page: Windows ten L
T S C 2021 or later, Windows eleven,

3
00:00:07.208 --> 00:00:12.611
and Windows eleven on Arm, which has
a separate installer; Azure Virtual

4
00:00:12.611 --> 00:00:18.563
Desktop single-session and Windows three
sixty-five, but not A V D multi-session.

5
00:00:18.563 --> 00:00:21.173
It can't be installed
on a machine that hosts

6
00:00:21.173 --> 00:00:24.075
virtual machines with a
Hyper-V external switch.

7
00:00:24.075 --> 00:00:28.561
The device must be joined, hybrid
joined or registered in the tenant,

8
00:00:28.561 --> 00:00:31.925
and registered devices
carry only Private Access.

9
00:00:31.925 --> 00:00:38.131
The client tunnels I P version four only,
and it doesn't support secure D N S,

10
00:00:38.131 --> 00:00:44.337
D N S over T C P from browsers' built-in
resolvers, or Group Policy N R P T rules.

11
00:00:44.337 --> 00:00:47.880
Like the rest of the service,
it's available in G C C.

12
00:00:47.880 --> 00:00:51.068
Hosts it can't run on go
on the exception list,

13
00:00:51.068 --> 00:00:53.690
each with an owner and a review date.
